    "description": "<p>Once per rest, you can conjure a thick, twisting stalk within Close range that can be easily climbed. Its height can grow up to Far range.</p><p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to use this spell as an attack. Make a <strong>Spellcast Roll</strong> against an adversary or group of adversaries within Close range. The erupting stalk lifts targets you succeed against into the air and drops them, dealing <strong>d8</strong> physical damage using your Proficiency.</p>",
